IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgaa-guarantee`

-- Superannuation Guarantee (Administration) Act 1992 (Cth) with the SG (Administration) Regulations 2018, the employee's questions -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case. The SG (Administration) Regulations 2018 are deposited and are read here.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_superannuation-guarantee-administration-act-1992_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts are from the workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-{chloe,jake,daniel}/facts.json: c020 (14 March 2018,
-- Chloe at 15, a casual supermarket job), c032 (20 November 2023, an internship at $25 an hour), c041 (29 February 2024,
-- a first monthly pay of $5,833.33; the life expects $641.67 at 11%), k041 (31 March 2027, Jake on a delivery platform),
-- k060 (1 February 2034, Jake a security officer at Sentinel on the award), d044 (1 June 2031, Jarrah's first three
-- employees). HYPOTHETICAL, because the lives do not state them: Chloe's hours and pay at 15, the intern's weekly pay,
-- Jake's platform earnings, the Sentinel fortnight's parts and payday, Jarrah's payday (6 June 2031) and pay, the
-- holiday on 9 June 2031, the concessional contributions cap, the daily general interest charge rate, and every amount in
-- the shortfall cases.

