    `it is a complying fund or scheme, or an RSA` IS TRUE
    `I am a member of it` IS FALSE
    `as far as the Commissioner knows it can accept contributions from my employer` IS TRUE
    `the Commissioner can disclose the information to my employer` IS TRUE
    `how many of my funds meet those four requirements` IS 1
    `a Commissioner's notice in the selection period named one of those funds` IS FALSE
    `it is the fund named in the most recent such notice` IS FALSE
    `one of those funds received a contribution for me in the selection period` IS FALSE
    `it received the most recent contribution` IS FALSE
    `the balances at the end of last financial year single out one fund` IS FALSE
    `it held my largest balance at the end of last financial year` IS FALSE
    `the Commissioner is satisfied it is the most appropriate` IS FALSE

